stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Normal
  Normal --> Advisory: remaining <= 900 s
  Advisory --> Normal: accepted turn
  Normal --> CriticalSound: remaining <= 0
  Advisory --> CriticalSound: remaining <= 0
  CriticalSound --> CriticalMuted: acknowledge
  CriticalSound --> CriticalTurnSeen: accepted turn
  CriticalMuted --> Normal: accepted turn
  CriticalTurnSeen --> Normal: acknowledge
  state TechnicalOverlay {
    [*] --> Clear
    Clear --> Technical: invalid / still for 5 s
    Technical --> Clear: fault input clears
  }
  note right of TechnicalOverlay
    Independent fault flag.
    Critical display outranks technical.
    After critical clears, active technical displays cyan.
  end note
